#: scenario5:scenario5_A1BC6589_AD46_4643_96C3_5BCB407C5728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65e3bb495f52d9afa29464cc4f8ee2b580d9c1d50611a59fa1c097dc422a89e3
